# REVIEW-ONLY, FAIL-CLOSED PLACEHOLDER — NOT APPROVED FOR LIVE CADDY.
# This intentionally has NO upstream route, NO source-IP VPN shortcut,
# and NO implied proof of private ingress, peer authorization or DNS.
#
# Before proposing an active reverse_proxy route, independently verify:
# 1. An authenticated, authorized NetBird/GoreeCloud VPN gateway peer.
# 2. A private VPN-only listener/firewall/peer ACL (not remote_ip 100.64/10).
# 3. A private AdGuard Home/GoreeCloud DNS rewrite to the VERIFIED VPN address.
# 4. TLS trust and host validation from an approved VPN client.
# 5. Isolated dev credentials, storage, backups and recovery acceptance.
#
# Even if accidentally loaded on a shared public Caddy listener, this
# placeholder MUST NOT proxy any request to the development backend.
# 'tls internal' is illustrative; it does not validate CA trust or
# authorize use on the live gateway.
drive-dev.goreecloud.com {
    tls internal
    respond "Development environment unavailable" 404
}
